  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acquisition of 20 Buses Project for the Transport of University Students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at providing efficient transport for the students of the University of Lome in order to improve the learning environment and help in the development of human resources.  The project includes: acquisition of 20 buses, spare parts for 2 years maintenance, workshop equipment, construction of bus berth and rehabilitation of the workshop.</narrative>
  </description>
